# 行尾统一 / Line endings
#
# 仓库里所有文本文件在 Git 对象中一律存 LF；检出时按下面的规则还原。
# 没有这份文件时，行尾取决于每个人的 core.autocrlf，克隆到 Linux/macOS 的
# gradlew 可能带上 CR 而无法执行。
#
# Every text blob is stored with LF. Without this file the result depends on
# each contributor's core.autocrlf, and a gradlew checked out with CRLF fails
# on Linux/macOS with "bad interpreter".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF / Windows batch files must stay CRLF
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf

# POSIX 启动脚本必须是 LF / POSIX launcher must stay LF
gradlew text eol=lf

# 二进制资产：不做行尾转换，也不做文本合并
# Binary assets: never converted, never merged as text
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.ogg    binary
*.wav    binary
*.mp3    binary
*.jar    binary
*.zip    binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.pdn    binary
*.psd    binary
*.blend  binary

# GitHub 语言统计：参考图与母板素材不是本仓库的代码
# GitHub linguist: reference art and source material are not this repo's code
docs/art/**    linguist-documentation
tools/assets/** linguist-vendored
